/*:
 * @plugindesc v1.4.0 [ID] - Animasi enemy kustom: sprite sheet atau PNG individual. Mendukung animasi State & Skill.
 * @author Anaryx Plugin
 * @url https://anaryx-plugin.itch.io/
 *
 * @help
 * ============================================================================
 * AG Enemy Animator Core v1.4.0 - Dokumentasi (Indonesia)
 * Author  : Anaryx Plugin
 * Website : https://anaryx-plugin.itch.io
 * ============================================================================
 *
 * Mengganti sistem animasi enemy default RPG Maker MV dengan sistem animasi
 * berbasis frame kustom. Mendukung DUA mode animasi:
 *
 *   MODE 1 - SPRITE SHEET  : frame tersusun horizontal dalam satu gambar
 *   MODE 2 - INDIVIDUAL PNG: file PNG terpisah per frame
 *
 * Kedua mode bisa dicampur bebas dalam notetag yang sama.
 *
 * ============================================================================
 * CARA CARI STATE ID / SKILL ID DI RPG MAKER MV
 * ============================================================================
 *
 * STATE ID:
 *   Buka Database → States → lihat angka di kolom paling kiri (ID).
 *   Contoh default RPG Maker MV:
 *     ID 1  = KO (mati)
 *     ID 4  = Poison (Racun)
 *     ID 5  = Blind (Buta)
 *     ID 6  = Sleep (Tidur)
 *     ID 7  = Paralysis (Lumpuh)
 *     ID 8  = Rage (Marah)
 *     ID 9  = Confusion (Bingung)
 *     ID 10 = Charm (Terpesona)
 *     ID 11 = Silence (Bisu)
 *     ID 12 = Slow (Lambat)
 *     ID 13 = Stop (Berhenti)
 *
 * SKILL ID:
 *   Buka Database → Skills → lihat angka di kolom paling kiri (ID).
 *   Misal: Skill "Fire" = ID 45, maka tulis skill_45
 *
 * AUTO STATE (state dari trait/passive enemy):
 *   Buka Database → Enemies → tab "Traits" → Add Trait → "State" → Auto State
 *   State yang di-assign di sini otomatis aktif saat battle dimulai.
 *   Plugin ini mendeteksi auto-state dengan cara yang sama seperti state biasa,
 *   jadi animasi state_N akan langsung aktif di awal battle.
 *
 * ============================================================================
 * NOTETAG DASAR - SPRITE SHEET MODE
 * ============================================================================
 *
 * Taruh sprite sheet di /img/enemies/ dengan nama sama seperti battler enemy.
 * Frame tersusun HORIZONTAL kiri ke kanan, lebar sama rata.
 * Frame width = total image width / jumlah frame
 * Index frame dimulai dari 0.
 *
 *   <AG_EnemyAnim>
 *   idle: 0-3 loop speed:5
 *   attack: 4-7 speed:4
 *   hit: 8-10 speed:6
 *   death: 11-15 speed:8
 *   </AG_EnemyAnim>
 *
 * Parameter:
 *   idle/attack/hit/death  - Tipe animasi (wajib)
 *   0-3                    - Range frame: start-end (wajib, gunakan N-N untuk 1 frame)
 *   loop                   - Tambahkan flag ini agar animasi berulang
 *   speed:N                - Tick per frame (lebih kecil = lebih cepat)
 *
 * ============================================================================
 * NOTETAG - INDIVIDUAL PNG MODE
 * ============================================================================
 *
 *   <AG_EnemyAnim>
 *   idle: img:actor1_1,actor1_2,actor1_3 loop speed:5
 *   attack: img:actor1_4,actor1_5,actor1_6,actor1_7 speed:4
 *   hit: img:actor1_8,actor1_9,actor1_10 speed:6
 *   death: img:actor1_11,actor1_12,actor1_13 speed:8
 *   </AG_EnemyAnim>
 *
 * File PNG diambil dari /img/enemies/ (tanpa ekstensi .png).
 * Bisa juga pakai range shorthand dengan ~ :
 *   img:actor1_1~actor1_3  = actor1_1, actor1_2, actor1_3
 *
 * ============================================================================
 * STATE ANIMATIONS - ANIMASI SAAT KENA STATUS (Poison, Sleep, dll)
 * ============================================================================
 *
 * Format: state_<ID>: <definisi animasi>
 *
 * Cara pakai (contoh Poison = ID 4, Sleep = ID 6):
 *
 *   <AG_EnemyAnim>
 *   idle: 0-1 loop speed:5
 *   state_4: 6-7 loop speed:3
 *   state_6: 8-8 loop speed:8
 *   state_7: 8-8 loop speed:10
 *   attack: 2-4 speed:4
 *   hit: 5-5 speed:6
 *   death: 9-9 speed:8
 *   </AG_EnemyAnim>
 *
 * Aturan state animation:
 *   - Aktif hanya saat idle (tidak interrupt attack/hit/death)
 *   - Kalau enemy kena beberapa state sekaligus, state ID TERBESAR menang
 *   - Kalau state habis, otomatis kembali ke idle biasa
 *   - AUTO STATE (dari trait enemy) otomatis terdeteksi dari awal battle
 *
 * Cara assign Auto State di RPG Maker MV:
 *   Database → Enemies → pilih enemy → tab Features (Traits)
 *   → Add Feature → State → States → pilih state yang diinginkan
 *   Animasi state_N akan langsung aktif saat battle dimulai.
 *
 * ============================================================================
 * SKILL ANIMATIONS - ANIMASI BERBEDA PER SKILL
 * ============================================================================
 *
 * Format: skill_<ID>: <definisi animasi>
 *
 * Gunakan ini kalau enemy punya beberapa skill dengan animasi berbeda.
 * Contoh: skill biasa pakai frame 2-4, skill spesial "Fire" (ID 45) pakai 10-13
 *
 *   <AG_EnemyAnim>
 *   idle: 0-1 loop speed:5
 *   attack: 2-4 speed:4
 *   skill_45: 10-13 speed:3
 *   skill_46: img:boss_special1,boss_special2,boss_special3 speed:3
 *   hit: 5-5 speed:6
 *   death: 9-9 speed:8
 *   </AG_EnemyAnim>
 *
 * Cara cari Skill ID:
 *   Database → Skills → lihat angka ID di kolom kiri.
 *
 * Cara assign skill ke enemy:
 *   Database → Enemies → tab "Actions" → Add action → pilih skill.
 *
 * Aturan skill animation:
 *   - skill_N punya prioritas sama dengan attack (3)
 *   - Kalau skill tidak punya animasi khusus, fallback ke animasi attack biasa
 *   - Setelah selesai, otomatis kembali ke idle/state
 *
 * ============================================================================
 * MIXING MODE SPRITE SHEET + PNG
 * ============================================================================
 *
 *   <AG_EnemyAnim>
 *   idle: img:actor1_1,actor1_2,actor1_3 loop speed:5
 *   attack: 4-7 speed:4
 *   skill_45: img:boss_fire1,boss_fire2 speed:3
 *   state_4: img:actor1_poison1,actor1_poison2 loop speed:4
 *   hit: img:actor1_8,actor1_9,actor1_10 speed:6
 *   death: 11-15 speed:8
 *   </AG_EnemyAnim>
 *
 * ============================================================================
 * DISPLAY SIZE (opsional)
 * ============================================================================
 *
 *   size: 128x192       → ukuran absolut pixel
 *   size: 50%x75%       → persen dari ukuran asli bitmap
 *   size: 50%           → scale uniform
 *
 * ============================================================================
 * HUE SHIFT (opsional)
 * ============================================================================
 *
 *   hue: 180    → 0 = tidak berubah, 360 = satu putaran penuh
 *
 * ============================================================================
 * ATTACK ZOOM TWEEN (opsional)
 * ============================================================================
 *
 *   attackzoom: scale:1.4 offsety:60 duration:12
 *
 *   scale:N    → zoom multiplier puncak (default: 1.3)
 *   offsety:N  → geser bawah saat puncak dalam pixel (default: 40)
 *   duration:N → durasi tween dalam frames (default: 10)
 *
 * ============================================================================
 * ANIMATION PRIORITY
 * ============================================================================
 *   death (5) > hit (4) > attack/skill (3) > state_N (2) > idle (1)
 *
 * ============================================================================
 * CONTOH LENGKAP
 * ============================================================================
 *
 *   <AG_EnemyAnim>
 *   size: 200x300
 *   hue: 0
 *   attackzoom: scale:1.3 offsety:40 duration:10
 *   idle: 0-1 loop speed:6
 *   attack: 2-4 speed:4
 *   skill_45: 10-13 speed:3
 *   skill_46: img:boss_special1,boss_special2 speed:3
 *   state_4: 6-7 loop speed:3
 *   state_6: 8-8 loop speed:8
 *   hit: 5-5 speed:6
 *   death: 9-9 speed:8
 *   </AG_EnemyAnim>
 *
 * ============================================================================
 */

